 leaning either way. The lone recent poll, a Democratic-sponsored survey from mid-September, showed McCann ahead by a single point. Prediction markets price the contest almost exactly even, with a slight edge to Huizenga. With Buttigieg campaigning for McCann and heavy spending on both sides, the outcome hinges on turnout and the final weeks of the environment.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.5309, "margin": 0.42}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.4667, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.4711, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.4732, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.4842, "margin": 0.3}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.4178, "margin": -0.7}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.4942, "margin": -0.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.4707, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.417, "margin": -1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.4657, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.5306, "margin": 0.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.4314, "margin": -1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.5595, "margin": 0.4}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.4501, "margin": -0.3}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.5027, "margin": 0.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.4045, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.4996, "margin": 0.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.4991, "margin": 0.5}]}